message: "If you use TenSeiAi, please cite this repository."
title: "TenSeiAi: a local AI engine built from scratch"
version: "8.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Koustubh12345/TenSeiAi"
keywords:
  - local-ai
  - from-scratch
  - transformer
  - mixture-of-experts
  - retrieval
  - sqlite
  - python
authors:
  - name: "Koustubh Gaikwad"
    alias: "Koustubh12345"
abstract: >-
  TenSeiAi is a self-contained local AI stack combining a small
  Transformer/Mixture-of-Experts language core, hybrid retrieval over a SQLite
  knowledge base, deterministic solvers, a local web chat, and an
  OpenAI-compatible API. The project does not use Llama, GGUF, or pretrained
  weights.
